#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:3
msgid "Blog"
msgstr "網誌"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:5
msgid ""
"**Odoo Blog** lets you manage blog pages and posts, and customize them with "
"the website builder."
msgstr "**Odoo 網誌**讓您管理網誌頁面及文章，並使用網站建立工具進行自訂。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:8
msgid ""
"Install the :guilabel:`Blog` app by clicking :guilabel:`New` on the website "
"builder, then selecting  :guilabel:`Blog Post`, and clicking "
":guilabel:`Install`."
msgstr ""
"如要安裝 :guilabel:`網誌` 應用程式，請在網站建立工具中點擊 :guilabel:`新增`，"
"然後選擇 :guilabel:`網誌文章`，再點擊 :guilabel:`安裝`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Blogs [video] "
"<https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/blogs-6935>`_"
msgstr "`Odoo 教學：網誌 [影片] <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/blogs-6935>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:15
msgid "Blog posts"
msgstr "網誌文章"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:17
msgid ""
"To create a blog post, click :guilabel:`New` on the website builder and "
"click :guilabel:`Blog Post`. Select a :ref:`blog <blog/blog-pages>`, define "
"a :guilabel:`Blog Post Title`, and click :guilabel:`Save`. Write the post's "
"content and customize it using the website builder."
msgstr ""
"若要建立網誌文章，請在網站建立工具中按一下 :guilabel:`新增`，然後按一下 "
":guilabel:`網誌文章`。選取一個 :ref:`網誌 <blog/blog-pages>`，定義 "
":guilabel:`網誌文章標題`，然後按一下 :guilabel:`儲存`。最後撰寫文章內容，並使"
"用網站建立工具進行自訂。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:21
msgid ""
"To publish a post, toggle the :guilabel:`Unpublished` switch in the top-"
"right corner of the page."
msgstr "要發佈文章，請切換頁面右上角的 :guilabel:`未發佈` 開關。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:23
msgid ""
"To delete a blog post, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Site --> Blog "
"post`. Select the blog post to delete, click :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`Actions`, and :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`Delete`."
msgstr ""
"要刪除網誌文章，請前往:menuselection:`網站 --> 網站 --> 網誌文章`。選擇要刪除"
"的網誌文章，按一下:icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`動作`，然後按一下:icon:`fa-trash-"
"o` :guilabel:`刪除`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:27
msgid "Customize blog posts"
msgstr "自訂網誌文章"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:29
msgid ""
"To customize the layout of all blog posts, open one and click "
":menuselection:`Edit --> Style`. Under the :guilabel:`Blog Page` section, "
"different categories of options can be used to customize the posts:"
msgstr ""
"如要自訂所有網誌文章的版面配置，請開啟其中一篇文章並按一下 :menuselection:`編"
"輯 --> 樣式` 。在 :guilabel:`網誌頁面` 區段下，可使用不同類別的選項來自訂文章"
"："

