#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:51
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Container Size`: choose the width of the post's content: "
":guilabel:`Small`, :guilabel:`Regular`, or :guilabel:`Full`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`容器大小`：選擇文章內容的寬度：:guilabel:`小`、:guilabel:`一般` "
