":icon:`fa-ban` (:guilabel:`None`) icon and selecting a color."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`背景`：點擊 :icon:`os-camera` :guilabel:`（相機）` 圖示以新增圖片"
"，或點擊 :icon:`fa-ban` (:guilabel:`無`) 圖示並選擇顏色，以使用背景顏色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/blog.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Size`: select the size of the cover (:guilabel:`Full screen`, "
":guilabel:`Half screen`, or :guilabel:`Fit text`)."
msgstr ""

