"及 :ref:`結帳 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>`，例如在 "
":doc:`B2B <../ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c>` 業務架構中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:178
