#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:180
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Order summary` step allows customers to see the items they "
"added to their cart, adjust quantities, :guilabel:`Remove` products, and "
":ref:`reorder products from a previous order <ecommerce/checkout/reorder>`. "
"Information on product prices and the taxes applied is also displayed. "
"Customers can then click the :guilabel:`Checkout` :icon:`fa-chevron-right` "
"button to continue to the :ref:`Address <ecommerce/checkout/delivery>` step."
