":doc:`create a form <../../website/web_design/building_blocks/forms>`, "
"customize it, and in the :guilabel:`Action` field, select :guilabel:`Create "
"a customer`."
msgstr ""
"經營 B2B 業務時，您通常會在網上商店 :ref:`隱藏價格 <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>"
"`，並僅向 :ref:`已登入用戶 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` 提供。"
"為防止任何人隨意註冊，請將 :ref:`客戶帳戶 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"account-creation>` 設定選項設為 :guilabel:`憑邀請`。若要建立讓客戶申請存取權"
"限的頁面，請開啟 :doc:`網站編輯器 </applications/websites/website/web_design>"
"`，:doc:`建立表單 <../../website/web_design/building_blocks/forms>` 並自訂該"
"表單，然後在 :guilabel:`操作` 欄位中選擇 :guilabel:`建立客戶`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:54
msgid ""
"You can assign tags created on a contact form under :menuselection:`Website "
"--> Configuration --> Customers` to identify what kind of customers have "
"submitted the form. To do so, open the :doc:`website editor "
"</applications/websites/website/web_design>` and select a field in the form."
" Then, in the :guilabel:`Style` tab, click the :guilabel:`+ Field` button in"
" the :guilabel:`Field` section heading and set the field's :guilabel:`Type` "
"to :guilabel:`Tags`. Toggle the tags that should be automatically assigned "
"when a customer fills in the form and set the field's :guilabel:`Visibility "
"Rule` to :guilabel:`Hidden`."
msgstr ""
"你可以為聯絡表單指派在 :menuselection:`網站 --> 設定 --> 客戶` 下建立的標籤，"
"以識別提交表單的客戶類型。為此，請開啟 :doc:`網站編輯器 </applications/"
"websites/website/web_design>` 並選取表單中的欄位。然後，在 :guilabel:`樣式` "
"分頁中，按一下 :guilabel:`+ 欄位` 按鈕（位於 :guilabel:`欄位` 區段標題內），"
"並將該欄位的 :guilabel:`類型` 設為 :guilabel:`標籤`。切換啟用當客戶填寫表單時"
"應自動指派的標籤，並將該欄位的 :guilabel:`可見性規則` 設為 :guilabel:`隱藏`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:62
msgid ""
"When a customer submits the form, a new contact is automatically created in "
"the database. The contact is assigned the first pricelist from the list of "
"available pricelists, and, if applicable, the specified tags."
msgstr ""
"當顧客提交表格後，系統會自動在資料庫中建立新聯絡人。該聯絡人會獲指派可用價格"
"表清單中的第一個價格表，並在適用時加上指定的標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:66
msgid ""
"Submitted requests can be found under the :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Customers`. Select the customer you want to :ref:`grant portal"
" access <ecommerce/customer_accounts/grant-access>` to. Once done, the "
"selected customer is able to view the B2B prices and products. Make sure the"
" correct pricelist is assigned to their contact form."
msgstr ""
"已提交的申請可在 :menuselection:`網站 --> 電子商務 --> 客戶` 下找到。請選擇"
"要 :ref:`授予門戶網站存取權限 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/grant-access>` 的"
"客戶。完成後，所選客戶即可檢視 B2B 價格及產品。請確保其聯絡人表單已指派正確的"
"價目表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:73
msgid ""
"It is also possible to hide the entire shop from the public using the "
":ref:`Ecommerce Access <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` setting "
"and only make it available for logged-in customers."
msgstr ""
"你亦可以使用 :ref:`電子商貿存取權限 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>"
"` 設定，將整個網店對公眾隱藏，只讓已登入的客戶瀏覽。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:76
msgid ""
"Configure the :ref:`checkout policy <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-"
"access>` to allow/disallow guest checkout for B2C businesses."
msgstr ""
"設定:ref:`結帳政策 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>`，以允許或禁"
"止 B2C 企業使用訪客結帳。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:78
msgid ""
"Enable the :ref:`Shared Customer Accounts "
"<ecommerce/customer_accounts/multiple-websites>` feature to allow customers "
"to use the same account on :ref:`all <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-websites>` "
"your websites."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:83
