#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:81
msgid ""
"For products with :ref:`variants <ecommerce/categories_variants/product-"
"variants>`, specify the reference unit on each variant's form. If the "
"feature is enabled before the variants are created, all variants inherit the"
" reference unit of the main product."
msgstr ""
"對於具有 :ref:`變體 <ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>` 的產品"
"，請在每個變體的表單上指定參考單位。如果在建立變體之前已啟用此功能，所有變體"
"都會繼承主產品的參考單位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:86
msgid ""
":doc:`/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/uom`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/"
"uom`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:91
msgid "Pricelists"
msgstr "價格表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:93
msgid ""
"Pricelists in Odoo allow for managing flexible pricing rules and offering "
"different prices and discounts based on currencies, time periods, purchase "
"volumes, :ref:`customers' location <ecommerce/prices/geoip>`, and/or "
"customer type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:97
msgid ""
"To enable pricelists for eCommerce, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"section, enable :guilabel:`Pricelists`, and :guilabel:`Save`. Then, click "
":icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Pricelists` or go to "
":menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Pricelists` and :ref:`configure "
"<sales/products/pricelist-configuration>` the relevant pricelists."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:103
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Ecommerce` tab, configure options specific to online "
"sales, such as assigning a :guilabel:`Website` to a pricelist, allowing "
"customers to :ref:`select it <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`, "
"and/or adding an :ref:`E-commerce Promotional Code "
"<ecommerce/prices/promotional-code>`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`電子商務` 分頁中，配置專用於網上銷售的選項，例如將 "
":guilabel:`網站` 指派給價格表、允許客戶 :ref:`選取該價格表 <ecommerce/prices/"
"selectable-pricelists>`，及/或新增 :ref:`電子商務促銷代碼 <ecommerce/prices/"
"promotional-code>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:109
msgid ""
"If you are using several websites and want to use the same pricelist on "
"several of them, you need to duplicate the pricelist for each website. If "
"you do not assign any website, the pricelist will not be used, unless it is "
":ref:`selectable <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`."
msgstr ""
"如果你使用多個網站，並想在其中幾個網站使用同一價目表，你需要為每個網站複製該"
"價目表。如沒有指派任何網站，該價目表將不會被使用，除非它設為:ref:`可選 "
"<ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:113
msgid ""
"Pricelists can also be :ref:`assigned to a specific customer "
"<sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-application>`."
msgstr ""
"價目表亦可 :ref:`指派給特定客戶 <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-"
"application>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:117
msgid ""
"When pricelists are enabled in the Sales app, they are automatically enabled"
" in the eCommerce app, and vice versa."
msgstr "在「銷售」應用程式啟用價格表時，「電子商務」應用程式亦會自動啟用，反之亦然。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:119
msgid ""
"In the list of pricelists, order the pricelists by priority: the first takes"
" precedence over the second, the second over the third, and so on."
msgstr ""
"在價格表清單中，按優先順序排列價格表：第一項優先於第二項，第二項優先於第三項"
"，如此類推。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:121
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create specific pricelists for :ref:`variants "
"<products/variants/configure-variants>`."
msgstr "亦可以為 :ref:`變體 <products/variants/configure-variants>` 建立特定價格表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:125
msgid ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:130
msgid "Selectable pricelists"
msgstr "可選價格表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:132
msgid ""
"Selectable pricelists are useful, for example, when selling products in "
":doc:`multiple currencies "
"<../../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/currencies>`, and allow "
"customers to choose a pricelist using the pricelist selector in the catalog,"
" located next to the :ref:`search bar <ecommerce/catalog/toolbar-and-"
"filters>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:137
msgid "Pricelist selector on the e-commerce."
msgstr "電子商務上的價目表選擇器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:140
msgid "To make a pricelist selectable, enable :guilabel:`Selectable`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:143
msgid ""
"If a pricelist is designated as :guilabel:`Selectable` and not assigned to a"
" specific website, it is selectable on **all** websites."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:145
msgid ""
"If a pricelist does *not* appear in the selector, it may be due to the "
"following situations:"
msgstr "如果價格表 *並未* 顯示在選擇器中，可能是由於以下情況："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:147
msgid ""
"Only one pricelist is defined as :guilabel:`Selectable`, and the "
":ref:`contact has a pricelist assigned <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-"
"application>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:149
msgid ""
"Multiple selectable pricelists exist, but only those matching the customer's"
" :ref:`country group <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>` are shown. It is "
"strongly recommended to disable the :guilabel:`Selectable` option when using"
" pricelists with country groups on the e-commerce."
msgstr ""
"當存在多個可選擇的價目表時，系統只會顯示符合客戶所屬:ref:`國家/地區群組 "
"<ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`的價目表。在電子商務中使用設有國家/地區群組"
"的價目表時，強烈建議停用:guilabel:`可選擇`選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:155
msgid ":ref:`sales/products/currencies/currency-specific-pricelists`"
msgstr ":ref:`sales/products/currencies/currency-specific-pricelists`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:160
msgid "GeoIP & country groups"
msgstr "GeoIP 與國家群組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:162
msgid ""
"It is possible to display a specific pricelist based on the visitor's "
"location and IP address by assigning :ref:`country groups "
"<ecommerce/prices/country-groups>` to pricelists."
msgstr ""
"透過將:ref:`國家/地區群組 <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`指派至價目表，系"
"統可根據訪客的位置及 IP 地址顯示特定價目表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:167
msgid ""
"To do so, :ref:`navigate to the relevant pricelist form "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` and select the appropriate :guilabel:`Country"
" Groups`. Create or edit as many pricelists for specific regions as needed. "
"For instance, select :guilabel:`European Union` to apply the pricelist to "
"all EU member states."
msgstr ""
"要執行此操作，請:ref:`前往相關的價目表表單 <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`，然"
"後選擇適當的 :guilabel:`國家／地區群組`。按需要為特定地區建立或編輯多個價目表"
"。例如，選擇 :guilabel:`歐盟` 即可將該價目表套用至所有歐盟成員國。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:172
msgid ""
"To create a new country group, click :guilabel:`Search more...` in the drop-"
"down list, then :guilabel:`Create New`. Add a :guilabel:`Group Name` and "
"select the relevant :guilabel:`Countries`. Use :ref:`Custom filters "
"<search/custom-filters>` if needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:177
msgid "Each country group must contain at least one country."
msgstr "每個國家群組必須至少包含一個國家。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:180
msgid ""
"Use the following filter to add all non-EU countries to the country group."
msgstr "使用以下篩選條件，將所有非歐盟國家新增至該國家群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:182
msgid "`Country Groups` + `is not equal to` + `European Union`"
msgstr "`國家群組` + `不等於` + `歐盟`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:184
msgid "Filter for country group creation."
msgstr "用於建立國家/地區群組的篩選條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:188
msgid ""
"When using GeoIP to determine the appropriate pricelist, **all** pricelists "
"used on the e-commerce site must have a country group assigned."
msgstr ""
"使用 GeoIP 判斷適用的價目表時，電子商務網站上使用的 **所有** 價目表都必須指派"
"國家/地區群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:190
msgid ""
"It is strongly recommended to disable the :guilabel:`Selectable` option when"
" using pricelists with country groups. Indeed, all pricelists with the "
"relevant country group are automatically applied to the catalog, but if one "
"of them is marked as :ref:`Selectable <ecommerce/prices/selectable-"
"pricelists>`, the others will disappear as soon as customers select the "
"selectable pricelist."
msgstr ""
"使用設有國家/地區群組的價格表時，強烈建議停用:guilabel:`可選取`選項。事實上，"
"所有包含相關國家/地區群組的價格表都會自動套用至目錄；但若其中一個價格表標記"
"為:ref:`可選取 <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`，一旦客戶選取該可選"
"取的價格表，其他價格表便會消失。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:197
msgid "Imagine you create three pricelists:"
msgstr "假設你建立了三個價格表："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:199
msgid "`EU regular prices` with the `EU` country group assigned"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:200
msgid "`EU prices with discounts` with the `EU` country group assigned"
msgstr "已指派 `EU` 國家/地區群組的 `附折扣的歐盟價格`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:201
msgid "`US prices` with the `US` country group assigned"
msgstr "已指派 `美國` 國家/地區組別的 `美國價格`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:203
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Selectable` option is enabled for `EU regular prices` and "
"`US prices`, and the customer is from the European Union, only the "
"pricelists `EU regular prices` and `EU prices with discounts` will be "
"available. However, since the `EU prices with discount` list is not "
"selectable, it will disappear once the customer selects the `EU regular "
"prices` list, and prices will be displayed based on the `EU regular prices` "
"pricelist in the catalog."
msgstr ""
"如果為 `歐盟常規價格` 及 `美國價格` 啟用了 :guilabel:`可選` 選項，且客戶來自"
"歐盟，則只有 `歐盟常規價格` 和 `歐盟折扣價格` 價目表可供使用。不過，由於 `歐"
"盟折扣價格` 價目表不可選，一旦客戶選擇了 `歐盟常規價格` 價目表，該價目表便會"
"消失，而目錄中的價格將根據 `歐盟常規價格` 價目表顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:210
msgid "Pricelist application"
msgstr "價目表套用"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:212
msgid ""
"On the e-commerce, the *default* pricelist is automatically selected for "
"public, non-logged-in users when no country group is assigned. If "
":ref:`GeoIP and country groups <ecommerce/prices/geoip>` are used, public "
"users see the pricelist of their country group by default."
msgstr ""
"在電子商務網站上，若未指派國家/地區群組，系統會自動為未登入的公開用戶選取 *預"
"設* 價目表。如使用 :ref:`GeoIP 及國家/地區群組 <ecommerce/prices/geoip>`，公"
"開用戶預設會看到其所屬國家/地區群組的價目表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:216
msgid ""
":ref:`Logged-in users <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` with "
":ref:`assigned pricelists <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-application>` "
"see the assigned pricelist by default **if it is assigned to the website** "
"they are visiting. If not, the website's default pricelist is applied (i.e.,"
" the first available pricelist assigned to the website and without a country"
" group, following the sequence order)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`已登入用戶 <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>`如配有:ref:`已指派"
"的價目表 <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-application>`，**只要該價目表已指"
"派至他們正在瀏覽的網站**，預設便會看到該已指派的價目表。否則，系統會套用網站"
"的預設價目表（即按排列順序首個已指派至該網站且不設國家/地區群組的可用價目表）"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:222
msgid ""
"Assigned pricelists take precedence over country-based pricelists, when "
"applicable, unless the assigned pricelist is linked to a different country "
"group."
msgstr ""
"如適用，已指派的價目表會優先於按國家/地區劃分的價目表，除非已指派的價目表連結"
"至不同的國家/地區群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:226
msgid ""
"A customer from the United States visits the website. They do not have a "
"portal account. The :guilabel:`United States` pricelist is applied."
msgstr ""
"一位來自美國的顧客瀏覽網站，但沒有門戶帳戶。系統會套用:guilabel:`美國`價目表"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:229
msgid ""
"A different visitor, also from the United States, has the :guilabel:`Loyal "
"Customer Discount` pricelist assigned in their contact form. This assignment"
" takes precedence over the country group assignment, so the :guilabel:`Loyal"
" Customer Discount` is applied."
msgstr ""
"另一位同樣來自美國的訪客，其聯絡人表單中已指派 :guilabel:`忠誠客戶折扣` 價格"
"表。此指派優先於國家/地區群組指派，因此會套用 :guilabel:`忠誠客戶折扣`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:233
msgid "An example of various pricelists assigned to a website."
msgstr "將不同價格表指派至網站的範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:240
msgid "Discounts"
msgstr "折扣"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:245
msgid "Discounts programs"
msgstr "折扣計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:247
msgid ""
"To enable :doc:`discount programs "
"</applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount>` for your "
"e-commerce, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, "
"scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, and enable the "
":guilabel:`Discounts, Loyalty & Gift Card` feature."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:251
msgid ""
":ref:`Configure <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-programs>` the discount "
"program, make sure the :guilabel:`Website` option is enabled, and add the "
"relevant :ref:`Pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` and "
":guilabel:`Website` on the program form, if needed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`設定 <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-programs>`折扣計劃，確保已啟"
"用:guilabel:`網站`選項，如有需要，亦請在計劃表單上加入相關的:ref:`價目表 "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`及:guilabel:`網站`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:258
msgid "Permanent product discount"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:260
msgid ""
"When the price of a specific product is permanently reduced, the "
"strikethrough strategy is commonly used. This involves showing the new "
"discounted price, with the original price crossed out alongside it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:264
msgid "Price strikethrough."
msgstr "價格刪除線。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:267
msgid ""
"To display a permanently discounted price, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the "
":guilabel:`eCommerce` section, enable the :guilabel:`Comparison Price` "
"option, and :guilabel:`Save`. Then :ref:`go to the product form "
"<ecommerce/products/product-creation>`, enter the new (discounted) price in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales Price` field, and the original price (strikethrough) in"
" the :guilabel:`Compare to Price` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:274
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Compare to Price` field must contain a price that is higher "
"than the :guilabel:`Sales Price` for the original price to appear with a "
"strikethrough."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:278
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Compare to Price` is not displayed if discounted pricelists "
"apply. If you want to use the :guilabel:`Compare to price` with another "
"discount, configure a pricelist with a :ref:`promotional code "
"<ecommerce/prices/promotional-code>`."
msgstr ""
"若套用折扣價目表，系統便不會顯示:guilabel:`比較價格`。如欲配合其他折扣使"
"用:guilabel:`比較價格`，請設定包含:ref:`優惠碼 <ecommerce/prices/promotional-"
"code>`的價目表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:283
msgid "Discounted pricelists"
msgstr "折扣價格表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:285
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create :ref:`pricelists with discounts "
"<sales/products/price-rules>`. To do so, :ref:`create a pricelist "
"<sales/products/pricelist-configuration>` and :ref:`configure the discount "
"<sales/products/price-rules>`."
msgstr ""
"你亦可建立:ref:`附帶折扣的價目表 <sales/products/price-rules>`。要進行此設定"
"，請先:ref:`建立價目表 <sales/products/pricelist-configuration>`，然"
"後:ref:`設定折扣 <sales/products/price-rules>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:289
msgid ""
"If a :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` contains a "
":ref:`Discount <sales/products/price-rules>` price type, the price is "
"striked through for applicable customers, even if the :ref:`Comparison Price"
" <ecommerce/prices/permanent-discounts>` feature has not been enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:295
msgid ""
"If using pricelists with :ref:`country groups <ecommerce/prices/geoip>`, the"
" discounted pricelist must be assigned the same country group as the non-"
"discounted pricelist."
msgstr ""
"如將價目表配合 :ref:`國家/地區群組 <ecommerce/prices/geoip>` 使用，折扣價目表"
"必須獲指派與非折扣價目表相同的國家/地區群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:301
msgid "E-commerce promotional code"
msgstr "電子商務促銷代碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:303
msgid ""
"To offer a discounted pricelist for customers with a specific discount code,"
" access the relevant :ref:`pricelist form <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`, go"
" to the :guilabel:`Ecommerce` tab, and add an :guilabel:`E-commerce "
"Promotional Code`, e.g., `SUMMERSALE10%`."
msgstr ""
"若要為持有特定折扣碼的客戶提供折扣價格表，請開啟相關的 :ref:`價格表表單 "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`，前往 :guilabel:`電子商務` 分頁，並新增 "
":guilabel:`電子商務優惠碼`，例如 `SUMMERSALE10%`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:307
msgid ""
"Then, go to the :guilabel:`Rules` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, and "
":ref:`configure the discount <sales/products/price-rules>`. When a customer "
"enters the code during :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>`, "
"the discount is applied according to the configuration in the "
":guilabel:`Rules` tab."
msgstr ""
"然後，前往 :guilabel:`規則` 分頁，點擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行`，並 :ref:`設定"
"折扣 <sales/products/price-rules>`。當客戶在 :ref:`結帳 <ecommerce/checkout/"
"review_order>` 期間輸入代碼時，系統會根據 :guilabel:`規則` 分頁中的設定套用折"
"扣。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:313
msgid ""
"Make sure that the :ref:`Promo Code <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>` "
"option in the website editor is enabled and, if using :ref:`country groups "
"<ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`, that the discounted pricelist has the "
"same country group assigned as the non-discounted pricelist."
msgstr ""
"請確保網站編輯器中的 :ref:`促銷代碼 <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>` 選項已"
"啟用；若使用 :ref:`國家/地區群組 <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`，請確保折"
"扣價格表與非折扣價格表所指派的國家/地區群組相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:320
msgid "Preventing direct sales and hiding prices"
msgstr "防止直接銷售及隱藏價格"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:322
msgid ""
"Some businesses, such as :ref:`B2B shops <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>` or "
"companies that sell luxury or custom items, may want to showcase their "
"products online while restricting direct purchases and hiding prices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:326
msgid ""
"To control price visibility and prevent direct online sales on the "
"e-commerce site, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, and enable "
":guilabel:`Hide Add To Cart`."
msgstr ""
"若要控制價格的可見度並防止在電子商務網站上直接進行網上銷售，請前往 "
":menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 設定`，向下捲動至 :guilabel:`電子商務` 區塊"
"，並啟用 :guilabel:`隱藏加入購物車`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:330
msgid ""
"Then, select one of the following options from the :guilabel:`For` drop-down"
" list to define which products are affected:"
msgstr ""
"然後，從:guilabel:`針對`下拉式清單中選擇以下其中一個選項，以定義受影響的產品"
"："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:333
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`0 price products`: On the :ref:`product form "
"<ecommerce/products/product-creation>`, set the price to `0` for all desired"
" products, or create a :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` where "
"all product prices are set to `0`. The price is then **not** displayed on "
"the :doc:`product page <../ecommerce_design/product_page>`."
msgstr ""
"對於 :guilabel:`0 價格產品`：在 :ref:`產品表單 <ecommerce/products/product-"
"creation>` 上，將所有所需產品的價格設為 `0`，或建立一個將所有產品價格均設為 "
"`0` 的 :ref:`價格表 <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`。價格隨即 **不會** 顯示於 "
":doc:`產品頁面 <../ecommerce_design/product_page>` 上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:339
msgid ""
"Ensure the pricelist is assigned to the correct website and is listed first "
"among the website's pricelists."
msgstr "請確保價目表已指派給正確的網站，並在該網站的價目表中排在首位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:342
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Specific categories`: Select one or more product "
":ref:`categories <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>` from the "
":guilabel:`Categories` drop-down menu that appears. At least one category "
"**must** be selected. The price is only displayed for products in these "
"categories if it is **not** `0`."
msgstr ""
"如選擇 :guilabel:`特定類別`：請選取一個或多個產品 :ref:`類別 <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`（於隨即顯示的 :guilabel:`類別` 下拉式選單中"
"選取）。你 **必須** 至少選取一個類別。只有當這些類別中的產品價格 **不為** "
"`0` 時，系統才會顯示價格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:347
msgid ""
"Then, enter a redirect URL in the :guilabel:`Link URL` field. The "
":guilabel:`Add to Cart` button on the :doc:`product page "
"<../ecommerce_design/product_page>` for zero-priced products or the selected"
" shop categories is then replaced by a default :guilabel:`Contact us` "
"button, which can be :ref:`customized <ecommerce/checkout/prevent-sale>` if "
"needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:353
msgid ""
"Ensure no pricelist used on the e-commerce has been marked as "
":guilabel:`Selectable` to prevent accidentally displaying the zero-priced "
"pricelist."
msgstr ""
"請確保電子商務所使用的價格表均未標記為 :guilabel:`可供選擇`，以免意外顯示零價"
"格的價格表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:355
msgid ""
"To hide prices from public visitors while keeping them visible to logged-in "
"customers, create a zero-priced pricelist for non-logged-in customers and "
":ref:`assign <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-application>` a regular "
"pricelist (with actual prices) to customers with :doc:`portal access "
"<../../../general/users/user_portals/portal_access>`."
msgstr ""
"如要向公開訪客隱藏價格，同時讓已登入的客戶看到價格，請為未登入的客戶建立零價"
"格價目表，並:ref:`指派 <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-application>`一般價"
"目表（包含實際價格）給擁有:doc:`門戶存取權限 <../../../general/users/"
"user_portals/portal_access>`的客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce allows you to :ref:`create products "
"<ecommerce/products/product-creation>` and manage their :ref:`visibility "
"<ecommerce/products/publish-products>` on the website. Products can be "
":ref:`configured <ecommerce/products/product-configuration>` in various "
"ways, including adding :ref:`product images and videos "
"<ecommerce/products/images>`, creating :ref:`product combinations "
"<ecommerce/products/combos>`, implementing :ref:`cross-selling and upselling"
" strategies <ecommerce/products/cross_upselling>`, attaching :ref:`digital "
"files <ecommerce/products/digital-files>`, :ref:`translating "
"<ecommerce/products/translation>` product information, :ref:`managing stock "
"<ecommerce/products/stock-management>`, and setting :ref:`packaging options "
"<ecommerce/products/stock-management/packagings>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 電子商務讓你可 :ref:`建立產品 <ecommerce/products/product-creation>`，並"
"管理產品在網站上的 :ref:`顯示狀態 <ecommerce/products/publish-products>`。產"
"品可透過多種方式進行 :ref:`設定 <ecommerce/products/product-configuration>`，"
"包括加入 :ref:`產品圖片和影片 <ecommerce/products/images>`、建立 :ref:`產品組"
"合 <ecommerce/products/combos>`、實施 :ref:`交叉銷售及追加銷售策略 "
"<ecommerce/products/cross_upselling>`、附加 :ref:`數碼檔案 <ecommerce/"
"products/digital-files>`、:ref:`翻譯 <ecommerce/products/translation>` 產品資"
"訊、:ref:`管理庫存 <ecommerce/products/stock-management>`，以及設定 :ref:`包"
"裝選項 <ecommerce/products/stock-management/packagings>`。"

