"In the :guilabel:`Is Published` column, tick the box for any of the selected"
" products, then :guilabel:`Update` to publish them."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`已發佈` 欄中，勾選任何已選產品的核取方塊，然後 :guilabel:`更"
"新` 以將其發佈。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:80
msgid ""
"When managing multiple websites, the availability of a product on each "
"website can be set from the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-"
"form>`. Navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab, then in the "
":guilabel:`Shop` section, select the :guilabel:`Website` where the product "
"should be available. Leave the field blank to make the product available on "
"*all* websites. You can make a product available on either *one* website or "
"*all* websites, but selecting only *some* websites is not possible. To sell "
"the product on multiple specific websites without making it available on all"
" of them, **duplicate** the product for each website and assign the "
"corresponding website to each duplicate."
msgstr ""
"管理多個網站時，您可在 :ref:`產品表單 <ecommerce/products/product-form>` 設定"
"產品在各網站的上架狀態。前往 :guilabel:`電子商務` 分頁，然後在 :guilabel:`商"
"店` 部分，選擇應提供該產品的 :guilabel:`網站`。如將此欄位留空，產品將在 *所"
"有* 網站上提供。您只可設定產品在 *單一* 網站或 *所有* 網站提供，而無法只選擇 "
"*部分* 網站。如欲在多個指定網站銷售該產品（而非全部網站），請為每個網站 **複"
"製** 該產品，並為每個複本指派相應的網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:92
msgid "Product configuration"
msgstr "產品設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:96
msgid ""
"To add general information to a product, navigate to :menuselection:`Website"
" --> eCommerce --> Products` and select the relevant product. You can "
"configure various options, such as choosing a :doc:`product type "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type>`,"
" adding :doc:`variants and categories <categories_variants>`, or defining "
":doc:`prices <prices>`."
msgstr ""
"若要為產品加入一般資訊，請前往:menuselection:`網站 --> 電子商務 --> 產品`並選"
"擇相關產品。你可以設定各種選項，例如選擇:doc:`產品類型 </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/type>`、加入:doc:`款"
"式及類別 <categories_variants>`，或定義:doc:`價格 <prices>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:103
msgid ""
"Additionally, add an e-commerce-specific product description to be displayed"
" below the product name on the frontend :doc:`product page "
"<../ecommerce_design/product_page>`. To do so, go to the "
":guilabel:`eCommerce` tab, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Long description` "
"section, and write a description. Use Odoo's :doc:`rich-text editor "
"</applications/essentials/html_editor>` to customize the content."
msgstr ""
"此外，你亦可新增電子商務專用的產品描述，顯示於網站前端 :doc:`產品頁面 <../"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>` 的產品名稱下方。要執行此操作，請前往 "
":guilabel:`電子商務` 分頁，向下捲動至 :guilabel:`詳細描述` 區域並撰寫描述。你"
"可使用 Odoo 的 :doc:`多格式文字編輯器 </applications/essentials/html_editor>"
"` 自訂內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:110
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Go to Website` smart button to access "
"the frontend product page and :doc:`customize "
"<../ecommerce_design/product_page>` it using the :doc:`website editor "
"<../../website/web_design>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:113
msgid ""
"Product descriptions can also be generated using :doc:`AI "
"</applications/productivity/ai>`. To do so, type `/` in the :guilabel:`Long "
"description` section and select :guilabel:`AI` to open the :doc:`AI agent "
"</applications/productivity/ai/agents>`."
msgstr ""
"產品描述亦可使用:doc:`AI </applications/productivity/ai>`生成。為此，請"
"在:guilabel:`詳細描述`部分輸入 `/`，然後選擇:guilabel:`AI`以開啟:doc:`AI 代"
"理 </applications/productivity/ai/agents>`。"

