"組合。視乎設定，部分項目可能會產生額外費用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:149
msgid "Add the combo product to the cart."
msgstr "將組合產品加入購物車。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:156
msgid "Cross-selling & Upselling"
msgstr "交叉銷售及追加銷售"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:158
msgid ""
"Cross-selling and upselling are sales techniques used to present customers "
"with additional or higher-tier products and services from the :doc:`catalog "
"<../../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>`. Cross-selling focuses on "
"recommending accessory or :doc:`optional products "
"</applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products>` alongside "
"the item being purchased during ordering and checkout. Upselling, on the "
"other hand, encourages customers to choose a higher-priced or upgraded "
"alternative product."
msgstr ""
"交叉銷售與追加銷售是銷售技巧，用於向客戶展示來自 :doc:`目錄 <../../ecommerce/"
"ecommerce_design/catalog>` 的額外或更高階產品及服務。交叉銷售著重於在訂購及結"
"帳期間，隨正在購買的項目一同推薦配件或 :doc:`可選產品 </applications/sales/"
"sales/sales_quotations/optional_products>`。另一方面，追加銷售則鼓勵客戶選擇"
"價格較高或已升級的替代產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:165
msgid ""
"To configure these product suggestions, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Products`, select the relevant product, go to the "
":guilabel:`Sales` tab, and add the desired products in the corresponding "
":guilabel:`Optional Products`, :guilabel:`Accessory Products`, and/or "
":guilabel:`Alternative Products` fields."
msgstr ""
"要設定這些產品建議，請前往 :menuselection:`網站 --> 電子商務 --> 產品`，選擇"
"相關產品，前往 :guilabel:`銷售` 分頁，然後在對應的 :guilabel:`自選產"
"品`、:guilabel:`配件產品` 及/或 :guilabel:`替代產品` 欄位中加入所需產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:172
msgid "Optional products"
msgstr "可選產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:174
msgid ""
"Optional products are suggested when the customer clicks the :guilabel:`Add "
"to cart` button to buy a specific product."
msgstr "當客戶點擊 :guilabel:`加入購物車` 按鈕購買特定產品時，系統會建議可選產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:177
msgid "Optional products cross-selling."
msgstr "可選產品交叉銷售。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:180
msgid "Accessory products"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:182
msgid ""
"Accessory products appear in the :guilabel:`Suggested accessories` section "
"during the :guilabel:`Order summary` step, just prior to proceeding to "
"checkout."
msgstr ""
"配件產品會在 :guilabel:`建議配件` 部分顯示，該部分位於前往結帳前的 "
":guilabel:`訂單摘要` 步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:185
msgid "Suggested accessories at checkout during cart review"
msgstr "結帳檢視購物車時的建議配件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:189
msgid ""
"To hide this section, open the :doc:`website editor "
"<../../website/web_design>`, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and toggle the"
" :guilabel:`Suggested Accessories` switch off."
msgstr ""
"要隱藏此部分，請開啟:doc:`網站編輯器 <../../website/web_design>`，前"
"往:guilabel:`樣式`分頁，然後關閉:guilabel:`建議配件`開關。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:192
msgid "Alternative products"
msgstr "替代產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:194
msgid ""
"Alternative products are displayed at the bottom of the :doc:`product page "
"<../ecommerce_design/product_page>` under the :guilabel:`Alternative "
"Products` heading."
msgstr ""
"替代產品會顯示於:doc:`產品頁面 <../ecommerce_design/product_page>`底部"
"的:guilabel:`替代產品`標題下方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:197
msgid "The alternative products section of an product page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:201
msgid ""
"To customize this block, open the :doc:`website editor "
"<../../website/web_design>`, click the block on the page, and :doc:`adapt "
"the heading and text <../../website/web_design/elements>` if necessary. Go "
"to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, scroll to the :guilabel:`Alternative Products`"
" section, and modify the options as needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:207
msgid ""
"To automatically add optional, accessory, and alternative products in the "
":guilabel:`Sales` tab, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, and enable "
":guilabel:`Automate suggested products`. Suggested products are assigned to "
"each product based on its :ref:`e-commerce category "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>`."
msgstr ""
"要在 :guilabel:`銷售` 分頁自動加入可選、配件及替代產品，請前往 "
":menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 設定`，向下捲動至 :guilabel:`電子商務` 部分"
"，然後啟用 :guilabel:`自動建議產品`。系統會根據每件產品的 :ref:`電子商務類別 "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>` 為其指派建議產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:216
msgid "Digital files"
msgstr "數碼檔案"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:218
msgid ""
"It is possible to link digital files, such as certificates, eBooks, or user "
"manuals, to the products. To do so, go to the :ref:`product form "
"<ecommerce/products/product-form>` and click the :icon:`fa-file-text-o` "
":guilabel:`Documents` smart button. Then, click :guilabel:`Upload` to upload"
" a file directly, or for additional options, click :guilabel:`New`. Choose "
"the :guilabel:`Type` of attachment:"
msgstr ""
"你可以將數碼檔案（例如證書、電子書或用戶手冊）連結至產品。為此，請前往 "
":ref:`產品表單 <ecommerce/products/product-form>`，然後按一下 :icon:`fa-file-"
"text-o` :guilabel:`文件` 智能按鈕。接著，按一下 :guilabel:`上載` 以直接上載檔"
"案；如需更多選項，請按一下 :guilabel:`新增`。選擇附件的 :guilabel:`類型`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:224
msgid ":guilabel:`File`: :guilabel:`Upload your file`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:225
msgid ":guilabel:`URL`: Insert the link to the file or media item."
msgstr ":guilabel:`網址`：插入檔案或媒體項目的連結。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:226
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cloud Storage` (if applicable): Insert a link to your cloud "
"storage to store the file on the :doc:`cloud storage "
"</applications/general/integrations/cloud_storage>` platform instead of the "
"database’s server."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`雲端儲存`（如適用）：插入你的雲端儲存連結，將檔案儲存在 :doc:`雲端"
"儲存 </applications/general/integrations/cloud_storage>` 平台，而非資料庫的伺"
"服器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:230
msgid "These documents can be made available:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:232
msgid ""
"On the product page (before checkout): Set the :guilabel:`Sales visibility` "
"field to :guilabel:`Hidden` and enable :guilabel:`Publish on website`."
msgstr ""
"在產品頁面（結帳前）：將 :guilabel:`銷售可見度` 欄位設為 :guilabel:`隱藏`，並"
"啟用 :guilabel:`在網站發佈`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:234
msgid ""
"In the :doc:`customer portal </applications/general/users/user_portals>` on "
"the confirmed sales order (after checkout): Set the :guilabel:`Sales "
"visibility` field to :guilabel:`On confirmed order` and disable "
":guilabel:`Publish on website`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:239
msgid ""
"In :ref:`Kanban <studio/views/multiple-records/kanban>` view, click the "
":icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`dropdown menu`) in the top-right corner of"
" the document card to :guilabel:`Edit`, :guilabel:`Delete`, or "
":guilabel:`Download` the document."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:246
msgid "Translation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:248
msgid ""
"If a website is available in multiple languages, product information can be "
"translated directly on the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-"
"form>`. Fields that support multiple languages are identifiable by their "
"language abbreviation (e.g., `EN`) next to the field, such as the "
":guilabel:`Product name`, :ref:`Out-of-Stock Message "
"<ecommerce/products/stock-management>`, the :ref:`e-commerce description "
"<ecommerce/products/description>`, :ref:`ribbon or badge "
"<ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-highlight>` names, "
":doc:`categories and variants <categories_variants>` names, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:257
msgid ""
"Having untranslated content on a web page may be detrimental to the user "
"experience and :doc:`SEO </applications/websites/website/structure/seo>`. To"
" avoid this, use the :ref:`Translate <translate/translate>` feature to "
"translate any remaining untranslated content on the page."
msgstr ""
"網頁上如有未翻譯的內容，可能會對用戶體驗及 :doc:`SEO </applications/websites/"
"website/structure/seo>` 造成不良影響。為避免這種情況，請使用 :ref:`翻譯 "
"<translate/translate>` 功能，翻譯頁面上所有尚未翻譯的內容。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:263
msgid ""
":doc:`Website languages and translations "
"</applications/websites/website/configuration/translate>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:269
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:215
msgid "Stock management"
msgstr "庫存管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:271
msgid ""
"To configure stock-related e-commerce options, go to :menuselection:`Website"
" --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"section, then to the :guilabel:`Inventory Defaults` subsection. The "
"following settings are available:"
msgstr ""
"要配置與庫存相關的電子商務選項，請前往 :menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 設"
"定`，向下捲動至 :guilabel:`電子商務` 部分，然後前往 :guilabel:`庫存預設值` 子"
"部分。以下為可用的設定："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:275
msgid ""
"If multiple :doc:`warehouses "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses>`"
" exist, select the relevant one from the :guilabel:`Warehouse` dropdown menu"
" to set it as the default."
msgstr ""
"如果有多個:doc:`倉庫 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses>`，請從:guilabel:`倉庫`下"
"拉式選單中選擇相關倉庫，將其設為預設值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:279
msgid ""
"Next to :guilabel:`Out-of-Stock`, enable :guilabel:`Continue Selling` to "
"allow customers to place orders even when the product is out of stock. Keep "
"this option disabled to prevent customers from ordering products that are "
"out of stock."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:282
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Show Available Quantity` option to display the "
"remaining available quantity on the product page when it drops below a "
"defined threshold. The available quantity is calculated based on the "
":guilabel:`On hand` quantity minus the quantity already :doc:`reserved "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/reservation_methods>`"
" for outgoing transfers."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :guilabel:`顯示可用數量` 選項，當剩餘可用數量低於指定門檻時，便會在產品"
"頁面顯示該數量。可用數量的計算方式為 :guilabel:`現有` 數量減去已為出庫調撥 "
":doc:`預留 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"reservation_methods>` 的數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:288
msgid ""
"These settings apply to *all* products, but can be adapted for individual "
"products if needed. To do so, go to the product form and ensure the "
":ref:`Track inventory option <inventory/product_management/tracking-"
"inventory>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"這些設定適用於 *所有* 產品，但如有需要可針對個別產品進行調整。要執行此操作，"
"請前往產品表單，並確保已啟用 :ref:`追蹤庫存選項 <inventory/"
"product_management/tracking-inventory>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:293
msgid ""
"When the :doc:`Inventory app </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory>` is"
" installed, and :ref:`lots and serial numbers are enabled "
"<inventory/product_management/enable-lot-serial>`, select an option from the"
" :guilabel:`Tracking` dropdown menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:297
msgid ""
"Then, navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab and, in the "
":guilabel:`Inventory` section, enable or disable the relevant "
":guilabel:`Sell when Out-of-Stock` and :guilabel:`Show Available Qty` "
"options. You can also compose a custom :guilabel:`Out-of-Stock Message`. If "
"the field is left empty, the default message `Out of Stock` is displayed on "
"the product page when the item is no longer in stock."
msgstr ""
"然後，前往 :guilabel:`電子商務` 分頁，並在 :guilabel:`庫存` 部分啟用或停用相"
"關的 :guilabel:`缺貨時繼續銷售` 及 :guilabel:`顯示可用數量` 選項。您亦可撰寫"
"自訂的 :guilabel:`缺貨訊息`。如果該欄位留空，當貨品不再有存貨時，產品頁面將顯"
"示預設訊息 `缺貨`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:303
msgid ""
"Modifying the general :guilabel:`Inventory Defaults` settings does not "
"automatically modify the related option(s) on the product form for existing "
"products; it only affects products created after the feature is "
"enabled/disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:306
msgid ""
"To display the stock level on the product page, the :guilabel:`Product Type`"
" field on the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-form>` must be "
"set to :guilabel:`Goods` or :guilabel:`Combo`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:309
msgid ""
"A :icon:`fa-envelope-o` (:guilabel:`envelope`) :guilabel:`Get notified when "
"back in stock` button appears on the product page when an item is out of "
"stock. Customers can click the link to enter their email address and receive"
" a notification once the item is back in stock."
msgstr ""
"當貨品缺貨時，產品頁面上會顯示一個 :icon:`fa-envelope-o`（:guilabel:`信"
"封`）:guilabel:`補貨時通知我` 按鈕。客戶可按一下該連結以輸入電郵地址，待貨品"
"重新補貨時接收通知。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:313
msgid ""
"You can also add an :ref:`out-of-stock ribbon or badge "
"<ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-highlight>` in the "
":guilabel:`Shop` section of the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab on the "
":ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-form>`."
msgstr ""
"您亦可加入 :ref:`缺貨絲帶或徽章 <ecommerce/products/additional_features/"
"product-highlight>`，相關設定位於 :guilabel:`商店` 部分（屬於 :guilabel:`電子"
"商務` 分頁，可在 :ref:`產品表單 <ecommerce/products/product-form>` 找到）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:316
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`Click & Collect <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>` feature is"
" enabled, the product availability is displayed on the product page based on"
" the stock in the warehouse defined on the related :doc:`delivery method "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method>`"
" form."
msgstr ""
"若啟用 :ref:`網購店取 <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>` 功能，產品頁面會根"
"據相關 :doc:`送貨方式 </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method>` 表單中指定倉庫的"
"庫存，顯示產品的可供訂購狀況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:323
msgid ""
"Currently, the `Boko Chair` is not available in any warehouses. However, "
"customers can click the :icon:`fa-envelope-o` (:guilabel:`envelope`) "
":guilabel:`Get notified when back in stock` link to receive a notification "
"as soon as the product becomes available again. A custom :guilabel:`Out-of-"
"Stock Message` can also be added to inform customers that the item will be "
"replenished."
msgstr ""
"目前，所有倉庫均沒有 `Boko Chair` 的存貨。不過，顧客可點擊 :icon:`fa-"
"envelope-o`（:guilabel:`信封`）:guilabel:`補貨時通知我` 連結，以便在產品恢復"
"供應時立即收到通知。你亦可加入自訂的 :guilabel:`缺貨訊息`，告知顧客該商品將會"
"補貨。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:329
msgid ""
"Example of a product that is out of stock, but which will be available "
"again."
msgstr "缺貨但即將重新補貨的產品範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:333
msgid ""
"If a unique reference is needed for inventory management, install the "
":doc:`Manufacturing app </applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing>` and"
" create :doc:`kit bills of materials "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/kit_shipping>`."
" Each kit links its published \"virtual\" products to the main reference "
"tracked in Inventory. This ensures that any item sold on the website is "
"converted into the corresponding stocked item in the delivery order."
msgstr ""
"如庫存管理需要唯一參考編號，請安裝 :doc:`製造應用程式 </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing>` 並建立 :doc:`套件物料清單 </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/kit_shipping>`。每個套"
"件都會將其已發佈的「虛擬」產品，連結至庫存中追蹤的主要參考編號。這可確保網站"
"上售出的任何項目，都會在送貨單中轉換為相應的庫存項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:343
msgid "Packagings"
msgstr "包裝"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:345
msgid ""
"To offer different product pack sizes to customers on the e-commerce, "
"configure product :doc:`packagings "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging>`."
" Then go to the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-form>` and "
"navigate to the :guilabel:`Sales` tab. Under :guilabel:`Upsell & cross-"
"sell`, add as many package types as needed in the :guilabel:`Packagings` "
"field. The available package types are displayed on the e-commerce "
":doc:`product page <../ecommerce_design/product_page>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:353
msgid "Product packages on the e-commerce page."
msgstr "電子商務頁面上的產品包裝。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:357
msgid ""
"It is also possible to add packagings to a specific :ref:`product variant "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>`. To do so, go to the "
"product form, click the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` :ref:`smart "
"button <products/variants/variants-smart-button>`, and select the relevant "
"product variant. Under :guilabel:`Sales`, add as many package types as "
"needed in the :guilabel:`Packagings` field."
msgstr ""
"你亦可為特定 :ref:`產品變體 <ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>"
"` 新增包裝。要進行此操作，請前往產品表單，點擊 :icon:`fa-sitemap` "
":guilabel:`變體` :ref:`智能按鈕 <products/variants/variants-smart-button>`，"
"並選取相關產品變體。在 :guilabel:`銷售` 下方的 :guilabel:`包裝` 欄位中，按需"
"要新增多個包裝類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:362
msgid ""
"To prevent selected packaging units from being sold on the e-commerce, go to"
" :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, and scroll down to"
" the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section. Then, under :guilabel:`Restrict "
"Packagings`, select the units that should not be available for sale."
msgstr ""
"要防止特定包裝單位在電子商務網站上出售，請前往:menuselection:`網站 --> 配"
"置 --> 設定`，向下捲動至:guilabel:`電子商務`部分。然後，在:guilabel:`限制包"
"裝`下方選擇不供銷售的單位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:9
msgid ""
"Customize the design of the :doc:`product pages "
"<../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page>`, structure the :doc:`product "
"catalog <../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>` and use :doc:`additional "
"features <../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features>` to improve the"
" customer's shopping experience."
msgstr ""
"自訂 :doc:`產品頁面 <../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page>` 的設計、規"
"劃 :doc:`產品目錄 <../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>` 結構，並使用 "
":doc:`其他功能 <../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features>` 以提升客"
"戶的購物體驗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:16
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:27
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:63
