"<ecommerce_design/product_page/buttons>`、自訂 :ref:`屬性詳情部分 "
"<ecommerce_design/product_page/attributes>`、啟用 :ref:`額外整理功能 "
"<ecommerce_design/product_page/page-features>`，以及使用 :ref:`建置區塊 "
"<ecommerce_design/product_page/building_blocks>` 新增內容。"

