#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Odoo's e-commerce workflow, an online purchase typically goes through "
"three main steps: :ref:`sale <ecommerce/handling/sales>`, :ref:`delivery "
"<ecommerce/handling/delivery>`, and :ref:`invoicing "
"<ecommerce/handling/invoices>`. Each step generates key documents, including"
" sales orders upon order confirmation, delivery orders to manage "
":doc:`picking "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods>`,"
" :doc:`packing "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack>`,"
" and :doc:`shipping <shipping>`, and invoices. Odoo eCommerce also offers "
"additional tools for sending :ref:`abandoned cart emails "
"<ecommerce/handling/abandoned_cart>`, ensuring :ref:`stock availability "
"<ecommerce/handling/stock-management>`, and handling product :ref:`returns "
"and refunds <ecommerce/handling/returns>`."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 電子商務工作流程中，網上購買通常會經過三個主要步驟：:ref:`銷售 "
"<ecommerce/handling/sales>`、:ref:`送貨 <ecommerce/handling/delivery>` 及 "
":ref:`開立發票 <ecommerce/handling/invoices>`。每個步驟都會產生主要文件，包括"
"確認訂單時產生的銷售訂單、用於管理 :doc:`揀貨 </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/picking_methods>`、:doc:`包裝 "
"</applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/multipack>` 及 :doc:`運送 <shipping>` 的送貨單，以及發票"
"。Odoo 電子商務亦提供其他工具，用於傳送 :ref:`遺棄購物車電郵 <ecommerce/"
"handling/abandoned_cart>`、確保 :ref:`庫存充足 <ecommerce/handling/stock-"
"management>`，以及處理產品 :ref:`退貨及退款 <ecommerce/handling/returns>`。"

