"將網站翻譯成一種或多種語言前，請先 :doc:`在資料庫安裝相關語言 <../../../"
"general/users/language>`。操作步驟如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:17
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`General` section, click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` "
":guilabel:`Install new languages`."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`一般`部份下，按一下 :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`安裝新語"
