"將 :guilabel:`語言選擇器` 欄位設為 :guilabel:`下拉式選單`、:guilabel:`行內` "
"或 :guilabel:`無`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:68
msgid ""
"You can :ref:`display or hide website elements "
