#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:117
msgid ""
"When you reach the :guilabel:`Data collection` step, choose the "
":guilabel:`Web` platform."
msgstr "到達 :guilabel:`資料收集` 步驟時，選擇 :guilabel:`網站` 平台。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:118
msgid ""
"Set up your data stream: Specify your :guilabel:`Website URL` and a "
