#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:3
msgid "Link tracking"
msgstr "連結追蹤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:5
msgid ""
"**Odoo Link Tracker** allows you to create shortened, trackable URLs to "
"measure the effectiveness of :ref:`marketing campaigns "
"<marketing_automation/marketing_automation/campaigns>` or monitor individual"
" day-to-day interactions such as sending personal offers. By adding tracking"
" parameters to URLs, you can easily identify exactly which channels, "
"platforms, or specific emails drive traffic to the website and make more "
"data-driven decisions."
msgstr ""
"**Odoo 連結追蹤器**讓你可建立簡短且可追蹤的網址，以衡量:ref:`推廣活動 "
"<marketing_automation/marketing_automation/campaigns>`的成效，或監察日常個別"
"互動（例如發送個人優惠）。透過在網址中加入追蹤參數，你可以準確識別哪些渠道、"
"平台或特定電郵為網站帶來流量，從而作出更以數據為本的決策。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:12
msgid ""
"To create and manage tracked links, the :guilabel:`Link Tracker` "
"(`website_links`) module must be :ref:`installed <general/install>`. The "
"module is then visible on the main Odoo dashboard when :ref:`developer mode "
"<developer-mode>` is activated."
msgstr ""
"要建立及管理追蹤連結，:guilabel:`連結追蹤器` (`website_links`) 模組必須"
"先:ref:`安裝 <general/install>`。啟用:ref:`開發人員模式 <developer-mode>`後，"
"該模組便會在 Odoo 主儀表板上顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:19
msgid "Create trackable URLs"
msgstr "建立可追蹤的網址"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:21
msgid ""
"To create and manage tracked links, navigate to the page you want to track. "
"Then, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Site --> Link Tracker`. Under "
":guilabel:`Create a Link tracker`, fill in the following information:"
msgstr ""
"要建立及管理追蹤連結，請前往你要追蹤的頁面，然後前往 :menuselection:`網"
"站 --> 網站 --> 連結追蹤器`。在 :guilabel:`建立連結追蹤器` 下，填寫以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:25
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Target Link`: The destination URL the website visitor is sent to "
"after clicking a tracked link. This field is automatically populated with "
"the URL of the page from which the :guilabel:`Link Tracker` menu item was "
"accessed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`目標連結`：網站訪客點擊追蹤連結後前往的目的地網址。此欄位會自動填"
"入使用者開啟 :guilabel:`連結追蹤器` 選單項目時所在頁面的網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:28
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Campaign`: The specific campaign the link should be associated "
"with."
msgstr ":guilabel:`推廣活動`：該連結應關聯的特定推廣活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Medium`: The channel or method through which visitors reach the "
"target link, such as organic search, paid search, social media ads, or "
"email."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`媒介`：訪客到達目標連結的渠道或方式，例如自然搜尋、付費搜尋、社交"
"媒體廣告或電郵。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source`: The specific platform, website, or channel that directs "
"visitors to your website, such as a search engine, newsletter, or referral "
"website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`來源`：將訪客導向您網站的特定平台、網站或渠道，例如搜尋引擎、電子"
"報或推薦網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:33
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`: A descriptive name for the tracked link, making it easier "
"to identify and manage."
msgstr ":guilabel:`名稱`：追蹤連結的描述性名稱，以便識別和管理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:37
msgid ""
"The parameters :guilabel:`Campaign`, :guilabel:`Medium`, and "
":guilabel:`Source` are optional."
msgstr "參數 :guilabel:`活動`、:guilabel:`媒介` 及 :guilabel:`來源` 均為選填。"

