#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/header_footer.rst:133
msgid ""
"Mega menus are similar to drop-down menus, but instead of displaying a "
"simple list of sub-menus, they show a panel divided into groups of "
"navigation options. They are especially useful for websites with large "
"amounts of content or :doc:`e-commerce websites <../../ecommerce>`, as they "
"can help include all of the web pages or :ref:`e-commerce categories "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>` in the menu while keeping all "
"menu items visible at once."
msgstr ""
"大型選單與下拉式選單類似，但不會只顯示簡單的子選單清單，而是顯示分為多組導覽"
"選項的面板。對於內容豐富的網站或 :doc:`電子商務網站 <../../ecommerce>` 而言，"
"大型選單尤其實用，因為它能將所有網頁或 :ref:`電子商務類別 <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>` 納入選單中，同時讓所有選單項目一目了然。"

