#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo allows you to :ref:`create <website/pages/page_creation>` different "
"kinds of webpages, including with the help of :ref:`AI <website/pages/ai-"
"generator>`, :ref:`publish <website/pages/un-publish-page>` them, and define"
" their structure and visibility by configuring :ref:`page properties "
"<website/pages/page_properties>`. Pages can be :ref:`duplicated "
"<website/pages/duplicate-page>`, :ref:`deleted <website/pages/delete-page>`,"
" and :ref:`redirected <website/pages/URL-redirection>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 讓您 :ref:`建立 <website/pages/page_creation>` 不同類型的網頁，包括借助 "
":ref:`AI <website/pages/ai-generator>` 的協助，並可 :ref:`發佈 <website/"
"pages/un-publish-page>` 網頁，以及透過設定 :ref:`頁面屬性 <website/pages/"
"page_properties>` 來定義其結構及可見度。此外，您亦可 :ref:`複製 <website/"
"pages/duplicate-page>`、:ref:`刪除 <website/pages/delete-page>` 及 :ref:`重新"
"導向 <website/pages/URL-redirection>` 頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:16
msgid "Page types"
msgstr "頁面類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Static** pages, such as the homepage or :ref:`custom "
"<website/pages/page_creation>` pages, contain fixed content that does not "
"change dynamically. You can manually create these pages, define their URLs, "
"and adapt their :ref:`properties <website/pages/page_properties>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"**靜態**頁面（例如主頁或 :ref:`自訂 <website/pages/page_creation>` 頁面）包含"
"不會動態變更的固定內容。您可手動建立這些頁面、定義其網址，並按需要調整其 "
":ref:`屬性 <website/pages/page_properties>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Dynamic** pages, on the other hand, display content that changes "
"automatically based on the data in the database and user interaction (e.g., "
"filtering). They are generated automatically by Odoo, for example, when "
"installing an app or module (e.g., `/shop` or `/blog`) or publishing a new "
":doc:`product <../../ecommerce>` or :doc:`blog post <../../blog>`. Dynamic "
"pages are managed differently from static pages."
msgstr ""

